{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0533_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1fe440dd77e13c0a73bb3d2ee8a3e0348a9fe0ed01aa19e3d1dc3c555548a8b5", "ja": "ええっ！？　なんでまた、撮影の前の日に？", "zh": "诶！？怎么又在拍摄前一天搞这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0533_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "3974b7e019be7bfa7a4380971b79a81114f707eec6349315aa7f9a585fdf16fe", "ja": "昨日、みんなに相談したんです。パジャマパーティーを\nしている時の気持ちって、どんな感じって……。", "zh": "昨天，我向大家请教了。问她们穿着睡衣开派对的时候，是什么样的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0533_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "bdf7b052cd5656298f5dd1567710bfa2ea93cae8063a14f7ecaf0a08ff9f9d1c", "ja": "そうしたら、体験するのが一番早いって言われて……\n断りきれずに、そのまま……。", "zh": "结果大家都说，亲身体验是最快的办法……\n我没能拒绝，就那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0533_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8c05296fa951f8070b7033260f9d8b50e927d47a93cf998c9da834c7629b5d69", "ja": "……今日のテーマは『パジャマパーティー』だもんな。\nそれで寝るのが遅くなったと。", "zh": "……今天的主题是“睡衣派对”嘛。\n所以才睡晚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0533_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "575538a43d1d90a2cef7baba7f8f203bff7f915d191c91c4c42d3de83c4cc385", "ja": "はい。すみません、{$P$}。\n撮影前日だって分かってたはずなのに。", "zh": "是的。对不起，{$P$}。\n明明知道第二天就是拍摄日。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0533_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "46be320e1041e4dec4846ff096dffdfb8c4feb0f893971e123b58c814ba2ce1f", "ja": "みんなと色々な話をしていたら、つい……。", "zh": "和大家聊着聊着各种事情，不知不觉就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0533_1010_p", "source_sha256": "85a9f9e2d0483eb7a56f81100bd77d5d077750e96f6c79f01eddb616753e85f5", "ja": "待て待て！　別に叱るつもりはないよ。\n……琴葉、パジャマパーティー楽しかったか？", "zh": "等等等等！我并没有要责怪你的意思哦。\n……琴叶，睡衣派对玩得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0533_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "3b8a68266ef52dbce22e64eb5875745c33eab1ba4708599cec0cb6a5b1465576", "ja": "えっ……？\nはい、楽しかったです！", "zh": "咦……？\n嗯，很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0533_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "186283bb9ca4c01c96e05422effe20f1a8610c64a6ad941caf3f38b7d877e2ff", "ja": "お気に入りのパジャマを着て、\n公演の思い出話や、お仕事の話をして……。", "zh": "穿上最喜欢的睡衣，\n聊着演出的回忆和工作上的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0533_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "673ff21bc11fdfc71833576ad0a37e0dc097fd9d7d1ff0ab518ad4a83dab4255", "ja": "最近見つけたお店とか、スイーツの話とか。\nなんだか、ずっと笑ってた気がします♪", "zh": "还聊了最近发现的店啊、甜点啊之类的话题。\n感觉整个人一直都在笑呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0533_1014_p", "source_sha256": "70db85bb210fa145c3f486beb6482cccc97ea31359fdc124ce7884a9f85b09b8", "ja": "そうか。なら、これ以上言う事はないよ！\nその経験を活かして、撮影に臨んで欲しい。", "zh": "这样啊。那我就没什么可说的了！\n希望你能活用那段经历，全心投入拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
